IRCv3 specifications

Source: https://github.com/ircv3/ircv3-specifications
Published form: https://ircv3.net/irc/

The copyright holders of each specification are listed in that file's
YAML front matter (`copyrights`).

The specifications as published on ircv3.net include this permission
notice, together with those copyright lines:

    Unlimited redistribution and modification of this document is
    allowed provided that the above copyright notice and this
    permission notice remains intact.

This notice has been part of the published specification template since
April 2015:

    https://github.com/ircv3/ircv3.github.io/pull/1

The upstream repository does not ship a LICENSE file. Adopting one
named license for the whole repository is still an open question:

    https://github.com/ircv3/ircv3-specifications/issues/426
